                <pb facs="0617" n="1351" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1351"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November 26,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reported massacre at Marash needs confirmation. Poche telegraphed on 19th that
                    foreigners there were safe. There are three Bahri Pashas; the one sent to Aleppo
                    as military commandant is a fair man. Zehni Pasha new vali of Aleppo, is also.
                    Guedjian is here, but not delivered, as promised by two Grand Viziers. Instruct
                    me.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
